        <content type="html" xml:base="/events/2023-07-04-php-google-cloud-functions/">&lt;h2 id=&quot;talk-1-php-and-google-cloud-functions&quot;&gt;Talk 1: PHP and Google Cloud Functions&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&#x27;ll use a &lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;snoofa-com&#x2F;statuspage-and-gcp-monitoring&quot;&gt;simple open-source tool&lt;&#x2F;a&gt; that connects Google&#x27;s Uptime Checks to Atlassian Statuspage as an example showing you how PHP can be used in Google Cloud Functions and how it can interact with Pub&#x2F;Sub. We&#x27;ll walk through the process of building and deploying a PHP 8.1 function. (lightning talk)&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;twitter.com&#x2F;TonyVlcek&quot;&gt;Tony VLCEK&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
</content>
        
